<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "BGM2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM2" "800" "2000" "WAIT"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\公園.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\桜とマンション.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\自室背景.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and the others had invited me, but I had turned them down and was lying on the futon in my room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't really know how much time had passed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was the hour when the orange evening sun was dyeing the room.</STYLE><PG>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and the others, what are they doing now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Surely they're enjoying the Cherry Blossom Festival at Central Park to the fullest.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But for me, going to the Cherry Blossom Festival is suicide.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How people can love cherry blossoms, I can't understand at all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I heaved a big sigh.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's not that I want to deny how people love the cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I know it's just me being strange.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hardly anyone sinks into a gloomy funk at this time of year.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Through the open window, along with a light breeze, came the bustle of the outside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There was no sound that particularly bothered me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now and then a child's voice, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">now and then the sound of a car, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">now and then the sound of the wind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And then...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "1000"}
{STOPSND "BGM2" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\インターホン.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The intercom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Getting up was a chore. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I thought about pretending nobody was home, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But in this season, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">at this hour, I had a pretty good idea who it would be.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
