{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "古郡玄関" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\インターホン.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Okay, okay, I'm opening it now.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "古郡玄関" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関開.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "春花" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "1000"}
<STYLE ID="1">When I opened the door, a high-school girl with short hair was standing there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just as I thought, it was </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "1000"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{PLAYSND "アサガオと始まり.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "800" "100"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "1000"}
"Hey!
{PAUSE ""}
　How's it going?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> greeted me cheerfully, in her usual way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">so-so."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I answered with something like a polite smile.</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "春花" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"So your April sickness still isn't any better this year." [TN: A pun on gogatsu-byo, 'May sickness,' Japan's term for the May blues.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, still smiling, twisted her mouth a little.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, it happens every year, so I'm used to it by now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... 
{PAUSE ""}
Over on our end, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> went around stuffing her face at one food stall after another, and it was rough."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Though she said it was rough, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> sounded happy telling me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> may be tiny, but she's a big eater.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Where does all that food go?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">At last I managed to answer with a natural smile.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, I had a few bites too, though.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, here. Souvenir!"<PG>
{CHANGECG "春花" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">I was handed a plastic bag, neither big nor small.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It felt pretty heavy in my hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's takoyaki. Eat it while it's hot. 
{PAUSE ""}
See you!"
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "春花" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "古郡玄関" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\靴足音.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "500" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "500" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{MESON "1000"}
<STYLE ID="1">Soon after the door closed, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I heard the door of the apartment next door open and close.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> had gone home at an oddly quick pace, but </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">she was probably worried about the strain on my body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Making </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> worry about me in all kinds of ways like this </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">has become my routine every year.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> doesn't mind. I know that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But still, I feel bad.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Heaving another big sigh, I took the plastic bag and went back to my room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
